        "geometry_type.descr": "<xdoc><p>The type of geometry to export.</p><ul><li><span title=\"FOOTPRINT\">Footprint</span>— Create a feature class showing the footprints of each image.</li><li><span title=\"BOUNDARY\">Boundary</span>— Create a feature class showing the boundary of the mosaic dataset.</li><li><span title=\"SEAMLINE\">Seamline</span>— Create a feature class showing the seamlines.</li><li><span title=\"LEVEL\">Cell size level</span>— Create a feature class based on cell size level of features in your mosaic dataset.</li></ul></xdoc>",
